                        "entry_id": "69884ac1-9e8e-3d2c-841f-8c692f256e72",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A tool for opening barrels by removing the bung."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9a43c9f6-4d25-4cc7-8cde-ed604baf12e7",
                                "sense_id": "6d4827a3-f207-3352-ae6d-7a470927896d",
                                "text": "But he had not yet learned to estimate these cool, languid, Southwestern knights of the bungstarter, who had the manners of an Earl of Pawtucket, ..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5bbd2e6f-e254-4072-b920-9c8fa1042147",
                                "sense_id": "6d4827a3-f207-3352-ae6d-7a470927896d",
                                "text": "The Portuguese equivalent of bungstarter whiffed Angus Jones by an eyelash."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2c589948-c260-4ba0-a699-1cc265e33215",
                                "sense_id": "6d4827a3-f207-3352-ae6d-7a470927896d",
                                "text": "That's where the barkeeper took a bungstarter and killed a man who was shooting wild."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4ed3c6d0-c350-4af6-9dc0-dcb5a3920ae4",
                                "sense_id": "6d4827a3-f207-3352-ae6d-7a470927896d",
                                "text": "\"Pat, let me have that keg,\" and the schoolteacher proceeded to hammer around the bung, in the way of the orthodox bungstarter."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "072be754-757e-408e-89a3-0159d960d8f2",
                                "sense_id": "6d4827a3-f207-3352-ae6d-7a470927896d",
                                "text": "When he came around the end of the bar he laid down the pistol and he was carrying a bungstarter in one hand."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
